{"3756080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bilson", "steam_appid": 3756080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/7b9d72444afa5edb25419c3d8fcc7a5f.avif?t=1782521893\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the story, you will play the role of the great detective Bilson, who has repeatedly solved major cases in Baotu City. However, due to a premeditated shooting, Bilson's lower body is paralyzed and he can only rely on high-tech consciousness transmission to solve cases and make a living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, this was unacceptable to the conservative and nostalgic Bilson, but in order to make a living, Bilson had to make compromises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/dde9788a2376b53657c2f6822b566191.avif?t=1782521893\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game map is divided into three major areas, with Baotu City available for players to explore freely. The remaining two areas currently require triggering mission conditions to explore a small portion, but will be opened one by one in subsequent updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Baotu City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/d0159ebbb81b960b2ab89e363652a010.avif?t=1782521893\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New city</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/21977367cd9973f1ec39dc680be3dec2.avif?t=1782521893\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cyber Kingdom<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/267b1225cf0d056747808750df701019.avif?t=1782521893\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple career systems in the game, and players can choose any profession as a means of earning extra income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains additional games that can be launched in internet cafes on the map. Completing these additional games can also serve as a means of earning extra income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/08115b0289146fa747295337013f9087.avif?t=1782521893\" width=1340 height=312 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/7b9d72444afa5edb25419c3d8fcc7a5f.avif?t=1782521893\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the story, you will play the role of the great detective Bilson, who has repeatedly solved major cases in Baotu City. However, due to a premeditated shooting, Bilson's lower body is paralyzed and he can only rely on high-tech consciousness transmission to solve cases and make a living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, this was unacceptable to the conservative and nostalgic Bilson, but in order to make a living, Bilson had to make compromises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/dde9788a2376b53657c2f6822b566191.avif?t=1782521893\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game map is divided into three major areas, with Baotu City available for players to explore freely. The remaining two areas currently require triggering mission conditions to explore a small portion, but will be opened one by one in subsequent updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Baotu City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/d0159ebbb81b960b2ab89e363652a010.avif?t=1782521893\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New city</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/21977367cd9973f1ec39dc680be3dec2.avif?t=1782521893\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cyber Kingdom<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/267b1225cf0d056747808750df701019.avif?t=1782521893\" width=1600 height=768 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple career systems in the game, and players can choose any profession as a means of earning extra income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains additional games that can be launched in internet cafes on the map. Completing these additional games can also serve as a means of earning extra income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/extras/08115b0289146fa747295337013f9087.avif?t=1782521893\" width=1340 height=312 /></span></p>", "short_description": "&lt;Bilson&gt; is an open-world detective game where players will take on the role of the great detective Bilson, solving various bizarre cases in an open world. The game not only features a main storyline for players to solve, but also offers a wealth of additional content for players to explore.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/a86574255f9f76458972a394eade545037cd5d30/header.jpg?t=1782521893", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/4c2bfeacbab6711c6804bef249024f8d93e4a81f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782521893", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756080/4c2bfeacbab6711c6804bef249024f8d93e4a81f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782521893", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / AMD FX 4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX1660<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 8.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> On-board Sound Card Compatible with DirectX</li></u